keiko 1
# K4 (an exact temp-path obstruction on the credential writer) — a commit fails
# with the save-the-key Notice, the stored row is preserved, no ping runs, and
# the retry after the obstruction is removed persists.
# Excluded: the absence of a partial file and of a ping (kept-sandbox and log
# checks), the write-before-check ordering (k3).
fixture credential fixtures/cred-stored.ron
fault write-blocked credential
setting play.text_speed 0

activate title.settings
expect control settings.key label "Set — sk-nano-…mnop"
activate settings.key
type "sk-nano-9999999999999999wxyz"
press Enter
expect surface settings
expect notice contains "Could not save the key"
expect control settings.key label "Set — sk-nano-…mnop"
unblock credential
activate settings.key
type "sk-nano-9999999999999999wxyz"
press Enter
expect control settings.key label "Set — sk-nano-…wxyz · not checked (see the log)"
